              "value": "(aura, divine, enchantment, fear, mental, visual)\n\n30 feet. When a creature ends its turn in the aura, it sees the face of a departed loved one in place of the evangelist's face. The creature must succeed at a 21 Will save or become frightened 2 (frightened 3 on a critical failure)."
