              "value": "Impaling Chain"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "When the evangelist critically hits with a chain Strike, the target is impaled and anchored in place, becoming grabbed by the chain. The creature is unable to recover from persistent bleed damage until it gets free (25 Escape)."
